# STL cylinder demo (KRK-GEO). Cartesian immersed-boundary path:
# the STL is voxelized into the is_solid mask. The stl(file=...) path is
# relative to the repo root — run this case from the repository root
# (e.g. `julia --project=. test/scratch/geo_stl_canary.jl`).

Simulation mgeo1_stl_cylinder D2Q9

Define U = 0.03
Define H = 1.0
Define cx = 1.0
Define cy = 0.5
Define R = 0.2
Define Re = 0.24

Domain L = 4.0 x 1.0  N = 80 x 20
Physics nu = 0.05

Obstacle cyl stl(file = "examples/geometry_stl/cylinder.stl", scale = 1.0, translate = [0.0, 0.0, 0.0], z_slice = 0.5)

Boundary west  velocity(ux = 4*U*y*(H - y)/H^2, uy = 0)
Boundary east  pressure(rho = 1.0)
Boundary south wall
Boundary north wall

Run 50 steps
Output vtk every 50 [rho, ux, uy]
